<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-biarmipes-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila biarmipes Turing wavelength at 1.5 µm (detail s0, 0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 88.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the Pass 1 Schnakenberg law (linear lambda_c = 1.486 µm, sigma_max = 0.391, ananassae sigma_max = -0.538, bipectinata lambda_c = 1.400 µm, equal-diffusion sigma_max = -0.102, Pearson r = 0.9998, RMSE = 0.0037, KS = 0.083). R1: the 128² centroid is 1.358 µm, against 1.259 µm on 96², so about half the gap to 1.486 µm was grid locking and a nonlinear shortening remains. R2: both centroids are printed on the comparison figure. GIF 720×540, 12 frames, cv_sim_similarity 82.3. The gallery plate is still not a 1.5 µm micrograph (need N1, left open). Overall 88.1/100 (faithfulness 87.9, reproducibility 88.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 84, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 90, Source and data traceability 88, Code-to-model traceability 88, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_biarmipes_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-biarmipes-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 635372 B, 1512×1104 px, artifact_sha256 cc98bff5da7b5bce905d2f461aa6439d286cdb75c6b71e1bf8c1a57918414fd7 (sha256 cc98bff5da7b5bce905d2f461aa6439d286cdb75c6b71e1bf8c1a57918414fd7), spec_fingerprint 92a782c52c8ca9f615d1f1bd608e11b29abe77968c127a57fb11ff06573e3b27. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 92a782c52c8ca9f615d1f1bd608e11b29abe77968c127a57fb11ff06573e3b27; artifact_sha256: cc98bff5da7b5bce905d2f461aa6439d286cdb75c6b71e1bf8c1a57918414fd7; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_biarmipes_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_biarmipes_specimen.jpg=02b2cb2ee9a1dfe4..., datasets/drosophila_biarmipes_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_biarmipes_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=7a8e083bfed7c064..., datasets/drosophila_biarmipes_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=703e65d53e861547..., datasets/drosophila_biarmipes_turing_wavelength_s0/scout_manifest.json=eba9988ac4767d3e...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-drosophila-biarmipes-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Gompel et al. 2005: D. biarmipes males deploy a novel yellow wing-spot enhancer. | Prud'homme et al. 2006: wing spots evolved repeatedly via yellow cis-regulatory elements. | Turing 1952: a finite critical wavenumber when the inhibitor diffuses faster than the activator.; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg (a, b, D_u, D_v) whose linear lambda_c equals 1.486 µm. | Ananassae subcritical and bipectinata shorter-wavelength shifts at fixed diffusivities. | 96² centroid 1.259 µm and 128² centroid 1.358 µm on the same 17.832 µm patch.; transfer_boundary: 1.5 µm is the Delphi 3_subcellular_um assignment, not a length reported by Gompel. | Chronoseries neighbors are catalog positions, not a phylogenetic ancestor chain.; does_not_claim: That yellow transcription is Schnakenberg kinetics. | That the gallery plate is a micrograph of a 1.5 µm melanin lattice. | That the saturated lattice wavelength equals the linear lambda_c.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [specimen_comparison/specimen-match, pressure P=1.8]: A CC-licensed micrograph of D. biarmipes wing-spot cuticle near 1 µm. Still open after Pass 2; the gallery plate remains the pinned specimen." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.81e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-biarmipes-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila biarmipes Turing wavelength at 1.5 µm (detail s0, 0 Ma) — Parameter expressivity: 90/100" ;
